.env*
# `.env*` above would also swallow the template. It is only safe today because
# the file is already tracked; if it is ever deleted or renamed, `git add`
# would report nothing to add and the template would come back unignored-and-
# missing. Keep the template committable.
!.env.example
packages/agent/kb-capture.json

# Local scratch: one-off probes and diagnostics written while working a problem.
